484","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":7200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1180,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c399","house":"kite","letter":"L485","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":7200,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1181,"t":7200,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1898,"retries":0},{"seq":1182,"t":7200,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is active near F1/F2, and Tiger is strong at F3. My doctrine suggests using cavalry to intercept riders and sending foot where enemy letters point. Rhino's letters mention F1 and NW. I'll use cavalry to pressure F1 and confirm enemy movements, while reinforcing my main line"},{"seq":1183,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c400","house":"orchid","letter":"L486","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":7200,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1184,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c401","house":"orchid","letter":"L487","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":7500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":1185,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c402","house":"orchid","letter":"L488","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":7200,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1186,"t":7200,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1708,"retries":0},{"seq":1187,"t":7200,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Watch 25. Doctrine: take East Ford (F3) early. I have forces at F3 (tiger-inf-1/2, tiger-arch-1). Kite arch/ele are near F3/N-east. I should reinforce F3 and press the advantage, while watching for Rhino/Orchid movements."},{"seq":1188,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c403","house":"tiger","letter":"L489","kin